From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dodaskot <pessdres@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 18:13:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 029/131] a22x: LVTS thermal sensors and CPU/GPU thermal zones

- thermal: mediatek: lvts: MT6833 AP domain (4 controllers, 13 sensors,
  vendor efuse layout); reset control is optional (MT6833 has none)
- dts: efuse cell, LVTS, zones for LITTLE/big/GPU/SoC with the vendor trip
  points (85/95 C passive); 117 C is 'hot' until readings are validated

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../boot/dts/mediatek/mt6833-samsung-a22x.dts | 190 ++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/thermal/mediatek/lvts_thermal.c       |  77 ++++++-
 .../thermal/mediatek,lvts-thermal.h           |  14 ++
 3 files changed, 280 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

